---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
// This notice covers the checklist signup, not site-wide checkout or cookies.
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Email signup privacy notice | Daniel Larson Training"
  description="How Daniel Larson Training uses information provided through its Florida licensing checklist email signup."
  canonicalPath="/email-signup-privacy/"
  robots="noindex,follow"
>
  <article class="signup-notice shell">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/licensing-checklist/">Licensing checklist</a> / Email signup privacy</nav>
    <h1>Email signup privacy notice</h1>
    <p>This notice covers information you provide through the Daniel Larson Training licensing checklist email form.</p>

    <h2>What you provide</h2>
    <p>The form asks for your email address. Your first name, licensing stage and permission to receive follow-up tips are optional. We use your chosen stage to make any requested follow-up relevant to you.</p>

    <h2>Confirmation and your email choice</h2>
    <p>Submitting the form requests a confirmation email. Its confirmation button verifies your address and opens the licensing checklist.</p>
    <p>If you also select the email permission box and confirm your address, Daniel Larson Training may send you licensing guidance, course information and first-renewal tips. Leaving that box unchecked does not sign you up for those follow-ups. You can use and print the checklist without submitting the form.</p>

    <h2>Our email service</h2>
    <p>We use Kit to process the form, store the signup information and email choices, send confirmation and follow-up emails, and manage subscription preferences. Kit handles information through its service as described in <a href="https://kit.com/privacy">Kit's privacy notice</a>.</p>

    <h2>Unsubscribe or contact us</h2>
    <p>Use the unsubscribe link in a marketing email to stop those emails. For questions about this signup or the information you provided, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    <address>Daniel Larson Training<br />2655 N Airport Rd #61236<br />Fort Myers, FL 33907</address>
    <p class="scope-note">This notice is specific to the checklist email signup. Course enrollment and payment use separate services.</p>
    <p><a href="/licensing-checklist/">Return to the free checklist</a></p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .signup-notice { max-width: 800px; padding-block: 48px 64px; color: #132840; }
  nav, .scope-note { color: #53667d; font-size: .88rem; }
  h1 { margin: 24px 0 22px; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  h2 { margin: 30px 0 12px; font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.3; }
  p { margin-block: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
  address { font-style: normal; line-height: 1.65; }
  a { color: #155eae; text-underline-offset: 3px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
